OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin cloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain. This will clear in the east
OL,7,Fduring the morning and all except the
OL,8,Ffar south in the early afternoon.
OL,9,FBright spells will develop in the east
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain in the far southwest at
OL,13,Ffirst otherwise dry with clear spells
OL,14,Fin the evening. Cloud will spread east
OL,15,Ffrom the late evening with rain
OL,16,Ffollowing after midnight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain at first,
OL,19,Fthe rain clears east before midday and
OL,20,Fbright spells increase during the
OL,21,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
